  "analysis": {
    "summary": "The first bar (bar 15 of the tune) sets up the turnaround with a minor-9th sound: the major-7th arpeggio built on the b3 of {{chord 1}}. The turnaround itself is a run: straight up {{chord 2}}, then the 3rd, b9 and b7 of {{chord 3}}, and a slurred triplet that encloses the b3 of {{chord 4}} chromatically, so the next chorus starts on a strong, minor-sounding downbeat.",
